    "text": "Consider the following statements :\nA: Rishi is a judge.\nB : Rishi is honest.\n$\\mathrm{C}:$ Rishi is not arrogant.\nThe negation of the statement \"if Rishi is a judge and he is not arrogant, then he is honest\" is"
